Subject: Cantor SJS Staged Diff Acquisition P1 Data Design

@ [data_design_uuid] 0d3e8ec6-d1c7-4f89-9721-f203a255cb96

& [AcquisitionRequest]
  + profile repository_id branch_ref expected_head object_format repository_root git_executable expected_git_sha256 generated_refresh_paths limits

& [AcquisitionReceipt]
  + profile request_sha256 git_executable_sha256 git_version repository_root branch_ref head object_format index_path index_before_sha256 index_after_sha256 inventory command_count observation_only physical_contact true nonauthority result_sha256

& [ProcessBoundary]
  + one absolute executable with expected raw SHA256
  + child environment cleared then fixed C locale terminal-prompt-off optional-locks-off lazy-fetch-off replacement-off system-config-off variables only
  + stdout stderr exit byte and entry bounds apply to every command

& [CommandSet]
  + version build options repository root branch HEAD object format absolute index path cached raw diff and raw blob reads only
  + exact config and flags disable external diff text conversion submodule recursion and ambiguous quoting
  + no hook config mutation write-tree update-index add commit push fetch or object-writing command

& [IndexSnapshot]
  + resolve one absolute index path within the resolved Git administrative directory
  + SHA256 raw index bytes before and after every command and refuse absence unreadability or drift
  + re-read branch HEAD object format and repository root after capture

& [DiffMapping]
  + A M D and R map to added modified deleted and renamed
  + an exact generated_refresh_paths subset remaps only M coordinates to generated_refresh
  + C T U unknown scores nonregular modes submodules null object IDs duplicate coordinates non-UTF8 or invalid normalized paths are refused
  + entries sort deterministically by status old path and new path before P0 self-digest generation

& [DigestDomains]
  + request and receipt use distinct length-prefixed SHA256 domains and self-cleared digest fields
  + DiffInventory continues to use the published P0 domain and validator
